<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Infrastructure on 随记</title><link>/tags/infrastructure/</link><description>Recent content in Infrastructure on 随记</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 22:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="/tags/infrastructure/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>中小规模企业的轻量开源 IT 基础设施选型</title><link>/posts/lightweight-on-prem-it-infrastructure/</link><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 22:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>/posts/lightweight-on-prem-it-infrastructure/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;这套方案面向 &lt;strong&gt;Windows/macOS/Linux 混合办公、控制面和数据完全自托管&lt;/strong&gt; 的中小型互联网公司。原则是优先复用已有平台，每个领域只保留一个权威系统；邮件网关与远程接入入口可以放在 DMZ，但不依赖外部 SaaS。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>